<ui-toast visible="{{!!infoMessage}}" message="{{infoMessage}}" tone="{{infoTone}}"></ui-toast>
<view class="invite-visitor-page {{viewportClass}} {{largeText ? 'is-large-text' : ''}}">
  <view class="mini-header" style="{{shellHeaderStyle}}">
    <view
      class="header-back"
      hover-class="is-pressed"
      aria-role="button"
      aria-label="返回更多工具"
      bindtap="handleBack"
      ><image src="/assets/icons/ui-chevron-left.svg" mode="aspectFit"
    /></view>
    <view class="header-title"
      ><text class="header-title-main">二维码与访客</text
      ><text class="header-title-sub">{{currentGroupName}} · {{currentGroupRole}}</text></view
    >
  </view>
  <scroll-view
    class="invite-visitor-scroll"
    style="{{pageScrollStyle}}"
    scroll-y
    enhanced
    show-scrollbar="{{false}}"
  >
    <view class="page-content">
      <view wx:if="{{state === 'loading'}}" class="page-state-card"
        ><ui-loading label="正在加载二维码与访客入口"></ui-loading
      ></view>
      <view wx:elif="{{state === 'error'}}" class="page-state-card"
        ><ui-alert
          tone="danger"
          title="二维码与访客入口暂时无法加载"
          message="{{errorMessage}}"
        ></ui-alert
        ><ui-button variant="primary" label="重新加载" bindpress="handleRetry"></ui-button
      ></view>
      <view wx:else class="invite-content">
        <view class="page-heading"
          ><text class="section-eyebrow">安全入口</text><text class="page-title">二维码与访客</text
          ><text class="page-description"
            >成员绑定码用于绑定微信身份；访客二维码只开放已发布排班，旧码刷新后立即失效。</text
          ></view
        >
        <view wx:if="{{!organizationEnabled || !guestEnabled}}" class="capability-note"
          ><text class="capability-title">部分入口暂未开放</text
          ><text wx:if="{{!organizationEnabled}}">组织管理写入能力关闭，无法生成成员绑定二维码。</text
          ><text wx:if="{{!guestEnabled}}"
            >访客入口能力关闭，无法刷新访客码或读取二维码。</text
          ></view
        >

        <view class="invite-card">
          <view class="card-header"
            ><view
              ><text class="card-title">成员微信绑定二维码</text
              ><text class="card-subtitle">为现有成员生成一次性扫码绑定入口</text></view
          ></view>
          <view class="editor-card">
            <view class="field-block"
              ><text class="field-label">绑定对象</text
              ><picker
                mode="selector"
                range="{{targets}}"
                range-key="name"
                value="{{targetIndex}}"
                bindchange="handleTargetPicker"
                ><view class="native-picker">{{targetLabel}}</view></picker
              ></view
            >
            <ui-button
              variant="primary"
              label="生成成员绑定二维码"
              disabled="{{!canManage || managementState === 'loading'}}"
              bindpress="handleCreateBindingQr"
            ></ui-button>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{bindingQrVisible && bindingQrImageSrc}}" class="qr-sheet"
            ><view class="qr-heading"
              ><text>成员微信绑定二维码</text
              ><view class="qr-close" aria-role="button" bindtap="handleHideBindingQr"
                >完成</view
              ></view
            ><text class="result-copy">{{bindingQrSummary}}</text
            ><text class="result-expiry">有效期至 {{bindingQrExpiresAt}}</text
            ><image
              class="qr-image"
              src="{{bindingQrImageSrc}}"
              data-src="{{bindingQrImageSrc}}"
              mode="aspectFit"
              show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}"
              bindtap="handlePreviewQr"
            /><text class="memory-note">扫码者确认后才会绑定；二维码一次有效，请勿公开。</text></view
          >
        </view>

        <view class="visitor-card">
          <view class="card-header"
            ><view
              ><text class="card-title">访客二维码</text
              ><text class="card-subtitle">只允许访问已发布排班</text></view
            ><text class="owner-badge">群主专属</text></view
          >
          <view class="visitor-body"
            ><text class="visitor-copy"
              >访客码不会显示完整密钥；刷新后旧二维码立即失效。已生成二维码永久保存，可长按保存或转发。</text
            ><view class="visitor-actions"
              ><ui-button
                variant="secondary"
                label="读取访客二维码"
                disabled="{{!canManage || !guestEnabled || !organizationEnabled}}"
                loading="{{visitorState === 'loading'}}"
                bindpress="handleLoadQr"
              ></ui-button
              ><ui-button
                variant="danger"
                label="刷新访客码"
                disabled="{{!canManageVisitorKey || visitorState === 'loading'}}"
                bindpress="handleRegenerateVisitorKey"
              ></ui-button></view
          ></view>
          <view wx:if="{{qrVisible && qrImageSrc}}" class="qr-sheet"
            ><view class="qr-heading"
              ><text>访客二维码</text
              ><view class="qr-close" aria-role="button" bindtap="handleHideQr">完成</view></view
            ><image
              class="qr-image"
              src="{{qrImageSrc}}"
              data-src="{{qrImageSrc}}"
              mode="aspectFit"
              show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}"
              bindtap="handlePreviewQr"
            /><text class="memory-note"
              >点击可预览，长按二维码保存或转发；访客码刷新后，已保存的旧二维码失效。</text
            ></view
          >
        </view>

        <view class="bottom-spacer"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
